tralia\", \"India\", \"C\"),\n    (\"In which year did the first Moon landing occur?\", \"1965\", \"1967\", \"1969\", \"1971\", \"C\"),\n    (\"Which is the largest planet in the Solar System?\", \"Saturn\", \"Earth\", \"Jupiter\", \"Neptune\", \"C\"),\n    (\"Which language has the most native speakers worldwide?\", \"English\", \"Spanish\", \"Hindi\", \"Mandarin Chinese\", \"D\"),\n    (\"What is the freezing point of water in Fahrenheit?\", \"0 degrees\", \"32 degrees\", \"100 degrees\", \"212 degrees\", \"B\"),\n    (\"Who painted the Mona Lisa?\", \"Vincent van Gogh\", \"Pablo Picasso\", \"Leonardo da Vinci\", \"Claude Monet\", \"C\"),\n    (\"What is the currency of Japan?\", \"Won\", \"Yuan\", \"Yen\", \"Ringgit\", \"C\"),\n    (\"How many players does a soccer team have on the field?\", \"Nine\", \"Ten\", \"Eleven\", \"Twelve\", \"C\"),\n    (\"Which element has the atomic number 1?\", \"Helium\", \"Hydrogen\", \"Oxygen\", \"Carbon\", \"B\"),\n    (\"What is the tallest mountain above sea level?\", \"K2\", \"Kangchenjunga\", \"Mount Everest\", \"Lhotse\", \"C\"),\n    (\"What does 'www' stand for?\", \"World Wide Web\", \"Wireless Web Window\", \"Web World Wide\", \"Wide Wireless Web\", \"A\"),\n    (\"Which planet is closest to the Sun?\", \"Venus\", \"Earth\", \"Mercury\", \"Mars\", \"C\"),\n    (\"How many minutes are in a day?\", \"1,000\", \"1,200\", \"1,440\", \"1,600\", \"C\"),\n]\n","filePath":"/workspace/backend/seed.py"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/workspace/backend/seed.py","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"backend/seed.py","time":{"start":1794301821327,"end":1794301821341}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c4b901890016eAZlhJdtGcPzA","sessionID":"ses_e3b52291effew79zs8gkkk9TtK","messageID":"msg_1c4b842fe001TLpXmQQPOEoiVH"}}
