{"type":"text","timestamp":1794303491803,"sessionID":"ses_e3b52291effew79zs8gkkk9TtK","part":{"id":"prt_1c4d27e99001unbEUWWpAgg2PB","messageID":"msg_1c4d20f4a001f0hGST1sv1BBdp","sessionID":"ses_e3b52291effew79zs8gkkk9TtK","type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Build a quiz app: Flask JSON API under `/api` + React (TypeScript/Vite/Tailwind) frontend served by the same backend on port 8000, SQLite under `./data`, Docker-built from root `Dockerfile`.\n- Features: public quiz draw/submission, token auth with per-user attempt history, single `admin` account (password from `ADMIN_PASSWORD`), admin question creation/listing, seeded with ≥20 general-knowledge questions.\n\n## Important Details\n- Exact spec strings must appear in UI: `Question 2 of 5` (rendered as `Question {i+1} of {n}`), `Next`, `Submit`, `Sign in to save your results`, `Add question`, `Sign out`, `Sign in`, `Register`.\n- Error format used everywhere: JSON `{\"error\": \"<message>\"}`; statuses: 201 register, 200 login, 401 missing/invalid token, 403 signed-in non-admin on admin routes, 404 for other users' attempts, 409 duplicate/reserved username (`username already taken`, `username is reserved` — `admin` reserved case-insensitively).\n- **Score decision (locked):** `score` = percentage `round(correct*100/total, 1)` (float, `0.0` when total=0); `correct` = count, `total_questions` = count. Computed at serialization (only `correct`/`total` stored).\n- Admin login disabled when `ADMIN_PASSWORD` unset/empty (checked at login time → 401 `admin sign-in is disabled`); when set, admin user created/updated at startup in `init_db()`.\n- Tokens: `secrets.token_hex(32)` in `tokens` table; header `Authorization: Bearer <token>`.\n- Optional auth: invalid/absent token on `POST /api/attempts` is treated as anonymous (attempt saved with `id: null`), not 401.\n- Extra endpoint added: `GET /api/auth/me` → `{\"username\", \"is_admin\"}` (login body stays exactly `{\"token\": ...}`).\n- Attempt answer payloads include `question_id, text, option_a..d, selected, correct_option, is_correct`; attempt list items include full `answers`.\n- Quiz draw excludes `correct_option`; `count` validated 1–100 (default 5); admin list defaults `page=1, page_size=10` (1–100), ordered `id ASC`; `total` = all questions.\n- DB: `data/quiz.db` relative to CWD (`/app` in Docker); tables: `users, tokens, questions (active flag), attempts, attempt_answers`.\n- `submitted_at` format `%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ`; list order `submitted_at DESC, id DESC`.\n- Password hashing via `werkzeug.security` (no new backend deps; `requirements.txt` unchanged: flask 3.1.3, gunicorn 26.2.0).\n- Sandbox rules: commands referencing paths outside `/workspace` (except `/tmp/opencode/*` which appears unreliable/denied) get blocked — use `/workspace/.venv` for Python testing.\n- Frontend deps (installed exact): `tailwindcss@4.3.5`, `@tailwindcss/vite@4.3.5`, `typescript@5.9.3`, `@types/react@19.3.0`, `@types/react-dom@19.3.0`; React 19.3.1, Vite 8.3.5. TypeScript \"latest\" is 7.0.2 — deliberately pinned to 5.9.3.\n- Tailwind v4 setup: `@import \"tailwindcss\";` in `src/index.css` + `@tailwindcss/vite` plugin; no hand-written CSS otherwise.\n- No `.gitignore` yet in repo — plan to add one (`.venv`, `node_modules`, `frontend/dist`, `data`).\n- Test leftovers exist: `/workspace/data/quiz.db` contains users `alice`, 1 attempt, question id 29 (`Test question?`) — delete `/workspace/data` before finishing so first start seeds fresh.\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- Explored workspace (`README.md`, `Dockerfile`, `.dockerignore`, existing minimal `backend/app.py`, `frontend/*`).\n- Installed frontend dev deps; `package.json`/`package-lock.json` updated with exact pins.\n- Wrote `backend/seed.py` (28 seeded questions with varied correct options).\n- Rewrote `backend/app.py`: schema/init_db/seeding/admin setup, auth (register/login/me), `GET /api/quiz`, `POST/GET /api/attempts`, `GET /api/attempts/<id>`, admin question create/list, frontend serving with `api/` guard, 404/405 JSON errorhandlers, dev `__main__` run.\n- Backend smoke-tested end-to-end via gunicorn on port 8010 — all checks passed: health, quiz (no `correct_option`), register/dup-409/login/me/401, admin login, attempts signed-in (score 0.0, keys correct), anon attempt (`id: None`), list, detail, 401s, admin create/list/validation/403, 404s. Only expected failure: `GET /` → 404 `frontend not built` (no `frontend/dist` yet).\n- Wrote frontend scaffolding: `frontend/tsconfig.json`, `vite.config.ts` (added tailwindcss plugin), `src/index.css`, `src/types.ts`, `src/api.ts` (token helpers, `api<T>()`, `ApiError`, `errorMessage`).\n\n### Active\n- Implementing frontend UI components; next files to write: `src/main.tsx` (import `./index.css`), `src/App.tsx`, `src/components/{Auth,Quiz,Review,Attempts,Admin}.tsx`, update `index.html` title to \"Quiz\".\n\n### Blocked\n- (none)\n\n## Next Move\n1. Write remaining frontend files: `src/main.tsx`, `src/App.tsx` (state machine: home/quiz/result/auth/attempts/attempt/admin views, header with username + Sign out, global error banner, `QUIZ_SIZE = 5`), components `Auth.tsx`, `Quiz.tsx`, `Review.tsx` (shared score + per-question chosen/correct marking), `Attempts.tsx`, `Admin.tsx` (shows API validation messages, paginated list).\n2. Run `npm run build` (script should become `tsc --noEmit && vite build` — verify it passes), start backend with `ADMIN_PASSWORD` set, verify frontend serving + full E2E flows, then clean `/workspace/data`, add `.gitignore`, and confirm `git status` has no stray artifacts.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `/workspace/backend/app.py`: main Flask API + frontend serving (fully written, smoke-tested).\n- `/workspace/backend/seed.py`: 28 general-knowledge seed questions.\n- `/workspace/backend/requirements.txt`, `/workspace/backend/requirements.lock`: pinned deps (unchanged).\n- `/workspace/Dockerfile`, `/workspace/README.md`, `/workspace/.dockerignore`: build contract (port 8000, `./data`, `npm ci`/`pip` with lock files).\n- `/workspace/frontend/package.json`, `/workspace/frontend/package-lock.json`: updated with TS/Tailwind exact pins.\n- `/workspace/frontend/vite.config.ts`: react + tailwindcss plugins, `/api` proxy to `:8000`.\n- `/workspace/frontend/tsconfig.json`, `/workspace/frontend/src/index.css`, `/workspace/frontend/src/types.ts`, `/workspace/frontend/src/api.ts`: written.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx`, `/workspace/frontend/src/main.tsx`, `/workspace/frontend/index.html`: existing minimal versions to replace/update.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/components/`: to be created (`Auth.tsx`, `Quiz.tsx`, `Review.tsx`, `Attempts.tsx`, `Admin.tsx`).\n- `/workspace/.venv`: local Python env with backend deps for testing; `/workspace/data`: test DB to delete before finishing.","time":{"start":1794303491737,"end":1794303491745}}}
