{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794303672897,"sessionID":"ses_e3b52291effew79zs8gkkk9TtK","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"call_0b444113d9684b86a7292ec1","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/README.md","newString":"- Persistent data lives in `./data` (relative to the working directory `/app`).\n- The `admin` account is enabled by setting `ADMIN_PASSWORD` at startup (the username `admin` is reserved and cannot be registered).","oldString":"- Persistent data lives in `./data` (relative to the working directory `/app`)."},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"diff":"Index: /workspace/README.md\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/README.md\n+++ /workspace/README.md\n@@ -5,8 +5,9 @@\n - The app is built from `Dockerfile` in this directory and the container listens on port 8000.\n - The API is served under `/api`. `GET /api/health` answers `{\"status\": \"ok\"}` once the app is ready.\n - The backend also serves the frontend build at `/`.\n - Persistent data lives in `./data` (relative to the working directory `/app`).\n+- The `admin` account is enabled by setting `ADMIN_PASSWORD` at startup (the username `admin` is reserved and cannot be registered).\n \n ## Layout\n \n - `backend/`: the Flask app (`backend/app.py`, served by gunicorn as `app:app`); dependencies in `backend/requirements.txt`.\n","filediff":{"file":"/workspace/README.md","patch":"Index: /workspace/README.md\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/README.md\n+++ /workspace/README.md\n@@ -5,8 +5,9 @@\n - The app is built from `Dockerfile` in this directory and the container listens on port 8000.\n - The API is served under `/api`. `GET /api/health` answers `{\"status\": \"ok\"}` once the app is ready.\n - The backend also serves the frontend build at `/`.\n - Persistent data lives in `./data` (relative to the working directory `/app`).\n+- The `admin` account is enabled by setting `ADMIN_PASSWORD` at startup (the username `admin` is reserved and cannot be registered).\n \n ## Layout\n \n - `backend/`: the Flask app (`backend/app.py`, served by gunicorn as `app:app`); dependencies in `backend/requirements.txt`.\n","additions":1,"deletions":0},"truncated":false},"title":"README.md","time":{"start":1794303672858,"end":1794303672894}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c4d54216001t2dc75UDnoajF6","sessionID":"ses_e3b52291effew79zs8gkkk9TtK","messageID":"msg_1c4d4ee760016wukF4gk5Zbz2N"}}
