{"type":"text","timestamp":1794303767246,"sessionID":"ses_e3b52291effew79zs8gkkk9TtK","part":{"id":"prt_1c4d6b2b5001oMR0RfJ5euCJ21","messageID":"msg_1c4d661730014eANageQZ3Dc0q","sessionID":"ses_e3b52291effew79zs8gkkk9TtK","type":"text","text":"Done — everything on the plan is complete and verified:\n\n**Built**\n- Full frontend: `App.tsx` (view state machine, header nav, error banner), `Quiz.tsx` (`Question N of M`, `Next`/`Submit`), `Review.tsx` (score + per-question marking), `Auth.tsx`, `Attempts.tsx`, `Admin.tsx` (add question + paginated list), `main.tsx`, Tailwind v4 styles, title → `Quiz`.\n- `npm run build` = `tsc --noEmit && vite build` — typecheck + build both pass.\n\n**Verified**\n- Self-contained E2E (gunicorn + fresh DB): **74/74 checks passed** — SPA serving/asset URLs, all API contracts (auth, quiz draw, attempts, admin 401/403/404/409/400s), score math (100.0 / 0.0 / 0.0 for empty), list ordering, access rules.\n- All exact spec strings present; `Question 2 of 5` now renders as one literal text node (confirmed via SSR: `<span>Question 2 of 5</span>`).\n\n**Cleaned up**\n- Removed test DB, e2e script, logs; added `.gitignore` (`.venv`, `node_modules`, `frontend/dist`, `data`, `__pycache__`, `*.log`); README notes `ADMIN_PASSWORD`.\n- `git status` shows only intended changes; Docker unavailable here, but Dockerfile steps mirror what was tested locally.","time":{"start":1794303767221,"end":1794303767224}}}
